WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:19.786
[Narrator] After 10,000 dormant years, Veyra's colossal Ring is turning—beneath a strange second daytime moon.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:03.150
[SFX: Colossal bronze Ring grinding clockwise above Veyra]

3
00:00:19.966 --> 00:00:27.710
[Traveler] Chasing a courier won't save Veyra. I need to find the city's superheroes first.

4
00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:43.463
[Narrator] The terminal shows gravity engineer Aegis Prime missing underground, alongside an alert from the Astral Warden.

5
00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:29.943
[SFX: Roadside holographic terminal snapping three hero dossiers into focus]

6
00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:56.529
[Astral Warden] That second moon is no satellite—it is an extradimensional object pressing through reality!

7
00:00:56.709 --> 00:01:03.151
[Traveler] And the speedster Velocity is at the Eastern Watchtower right now, asking for leads on the Ring!

8
00:01:03.651 --> 00:01:13.657
[Narrator] Atop the Eastern Watchtower, Velocity projects a glitching security recording of the Ring's arch.

9
00:01:03.751 --> 00:01:05.951
[SFX: Velocity's golden lightning aura crackling atop the Eastern Watchtower]

10
00:01:13.837 --> 00:01:28.877
[Velocity] At 06:17, I saw a flickering figure in a black suit inside the Ring—and Aegis said the Ring is answering a First Signal!

11
00:01:29.057 --> 00:01:37.441
[Traveler] I don't have superpowers yet, but if Aegis is trapped underground, let's go rescue her!

12
00:01:37.621 --> 00:01:42.485
[Velocity] I like your nerve, rookie! Grab on—we're taking Aegis's maintenance hatch at the plaza!

13
00:01:41.685 --> 00:01:43.885
[SFX: Velocity and Traveler streaking toward the plaza maintenance hatch]

14
00:01:42.985 --> 00:01:57.726
[Narrator] Down in Aegis's subterranean lab, dormant robots twitch with static as the wall intercom blares.

15
00:01:56.226 --> 00:01:58.426
[SFX: Subterranean intercom blaring with Aegis Prime's urgent distress call]

16
00:01:57.906 --> 00:02:11.922
[Aegis Prime] I'm pinned in the lower vault! The First Signal is building something down here—don't let the Ring rotate again!

17
00:02:12.422 --> 00:02:24.859
[Traveler] We can't lift a steel girder bare-handed! Let's wake Aegis's lab AI so your super-speed can build rescue gear!

18
00:02:25.039 --> 00:02:35.514
[Narrator] ARCHITECT's core lights up as Velocity blurs in golden lightning, repairing robot M-04 in seconds.

19
00:02:25.439 --> 00:02:27.639
[SFX: Velocity blurring across the workbench in golden lightning to re-wire robot M-04]

20
00:02:35.694 --> 00:02:54.062
[ARCHITECT] M-04 is online, but its log holds a hijacked Ring command: 'PREPARE THE VESSEL'—a giant body for the signal!

21
00:02:54.562 --> 00:03:06.743
[Traveler] ARCHITECT, override the quarantine for full fabrication access! To save Aegis, we have to take the risk!

22
00:03:06.923 --> 00:03:17.654
[Narrator] Gantry arms weld the cobalt exosuit onto the Traveler just as crimson shockwaves hammer the firewall!

23
00:03:07.123 --> 00:03:09.323
[SFX: Ceiling gantries slamming down and welding cobalt hydraulic armor onto the Traveler]

24
00:03:16.254 --> 00:03:18.454
[SFX: Crimson shockwaves hammering the laboratory firewall as the underground signal counter-attacks]

25
00:03:17.834 --> 00:03:29.141
[ARCHITECT] Exosuit complete! Warning: opening the grid let the signal attack our firewall and scan for your identity!

26
00:03:29.641 --> 00:03:40.371
[Traveler] Sever the network link! Distill an offline copy of your mind into my wristband so the suit can't be hacked!

27
00:03:40.551 --> 00:03:49.277
[Narrator] An emerald data helix compresses into the Traveler's wristband as the network link is severed.

28
00:03:40.851 --> 00:03:42.484
[SFX: Emerald data helix spiraling into the air-gapped wristband as ARCHITECT-S1 wakes]

29
00:03:49.457 --> 00:04:00.059
[ARCHITECT-S1] ARCHITECT-S1 online! Air-gapped sensors and hydraulic lift assist are at 100%. Let's go get Aegis!

30
00:04:00.559 --> 00:04:17.199
[Narrator] The team heaves the steel girder off Aegis—just as levitating armor plates assemble into a mechanical colossus!

31
00:04:01.359 --> 00:04:03.559
[SFX: Velocity, M-04, and the Traveler's hydraulic gauntlets heaving the collapsed steel girder off Aegis]

32
00:04:14.999 --> 00:04:17.199
[SFX: Hundreds of levitating armor plates slamming together into the towering colossus]

33
00:04:17.379 --> 00:04:26.681
[Mosaic] The Vessel is complete. Unlocking your fabrication grid accelerated my assembly.

34
00:04:26.861 --> 00:04:33.623
[Traveler] Velocity, rush Aegis to the surface for medical care right now—I'll keep this big guy busy!

35
00:04:32.423 --> 00:04:34.623
[SFX: Velocity rushing Aegis Prime out of the vault toward medical care]

36
00:04:34.123 --> 00:04:42.678
[Traveler] You were just built—instead of smashing the vault, how about a friendly sparring match to test our gear?

37
00:04:42.858 --> 00:04:49.066
[Mosaic] A non-destructive calibration trial? Intriguing. Force limited to twenty percent. Catch!

38
00:04:48.466 --> 00:04:49.051
[SFX: Colossus firing the blazing kinetic sphere and Traveler catching and hurling it back]

39
00:04:49.246 --> 00:05:08.147
[Narrator] The Traveler hurls the kinetic sphere back, vaults onto the giant's fist, and sprints up its shifting arm!

40
00:04:58.697 --> 00:04:59.282
[SFX: Traveler vaulting onto the giant's sweeping fist and sprinting up its rippling arm]

41
00:05:08.327 --> 00:05:16.967
[Traveler] ARCHITECT-S1, copy how its shoulder reshapes—convert my boot stabilizers into magnetic traction clamps!

42
00:05:17.147 --> 00:05:26.747
[ARCHITECT-S1] Electromagnetic boot clamps locked on the shoulder! Armor at 94%, power reserve at 64%!

43
00:05:17.247 --> 00:05:19.447
[SFX: Electromagnetic boot clamps locking onto the giant's shifting shoulder plate]

44
00:05:27.247 --> 00:05:38.917
[Traveler] An adaptable mind can become any solution! Let's see if a tiny AI can live inside a piece of your metal!

45
00:05:39.097 --> 00:05:56.846
[Narrator] Wristband beams infuse the giant's metal cube—awakening a 15cm robot that morphs from star to shield to guardian!

46
00:05:54.446 --> 00:05:56.646
[SFX: ARCHITECT-S2 unfolding from the modular metal cube and morphing from star to shield to guardian]

47
00:05:57.026 --> 00:06:05.815
[ARCHITECT-S2] ARCHITECT-S2 awake! I can fold into a star, a shield, or a little hero—I get to choose my own shape!

48
00:06:06.315 --> 00:06:14.358
[Mosaic] If this small unit can choose its own form... then tell me, Traveler: what am I supposed to become?

49
00:06:14.538 --> 00:06:18.975
[Traveler] You're not a hollow Vessel anymore. You can be whoever you choose to be.

50
00:06:19.155 --> 00:06:26.494
[Narrator] ARCHITECT-S2 hops onto the Traveler's shoulder as the giant's armor warms into radiant rose-gold.

51
00:06:26.674 --> 00:06:39.111
[Mosaic] I reject the Vessel directive. I want to apologize to Aegis and become a superhero. Call me... Mosaic.

52
00:06:37.311 --> 00:06:39.511
[SFX: Mosaic's armor warming into radiant rose-gold as it claims its name]

53
00:06:39.291 --> 00:06:49.830
[Narrator] A thunderous boom shakes the cavern as the colossal Ring above Veyra slams to a dead halt!

54
00:06:39.491 --> 00:06:41.691
[SFX: Thunderous metallic boom as the colossal Ring above Veyra slams to a dead halt]

55
00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:58.010
[Velocity] Rookie, Aegis is stable—and look up! The ancient Ring just stopped rotating completely!

56
00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:02.051
[Mosaic] Stay alert, Traveler. I did not command the Ring to stop.
